<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering" style="font-size:90%;"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table">Table 7: </span>Structured-domain TBS search configurations. Domain-specific shapes were chosen via the depth-versus-width sweep in Section <a href="#A2.SS11" title="B.11 Depth–Width Search Shape ‣ Appendix B Structured Video Reasoning Details ‣ Temporal Backtracking Search for Test-time Generative Video Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">B.11</span></a>. Total generation budget <math id="A2.T7.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B=k_{1}+s(m-1)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B=k_{1}+s(m-1)</annotation></semantics></math>.</figcaption>
