<section id="A2.SS8" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.8 </span>Failure Clustering Statistics</h3>

<div id="A2.SS8.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS8.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This section provides the numerical values behind the failure-to-recovery panel of Figure <a href="#S4.F5" title="Figure 5 ‣ 4.2 Main Results ‣ 4 Experiments ‣ Temporal Backtracking Search for Test-time Generative Video Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">5</span></a>(c) and quantifies the clustering observation that motivates TBS in Section 1.</p>
</div>
