</figure>
<section id="A2.SS9.SSS0.Px1" class="ltx_paragraph">
<h5 class="ltx_title ltx_title_paragraph">Cumulative EM by search depth (2D Maze).</h5>

<div id="A2.SS9.SSS0.Px1.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS9.SSS0.Px1.p1.1" class="ltx_p">On Maze, TBS continues to gain across multiple restart depths rather than saturating after the first restart.</p>
</div>
