</section>
<section id="A2.SS10" class="ltx_subsection">
<h3 class="ltx_title ltx_title_subsection"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_subsection">B.10 </span>Root-Width Sensitivity at Matched Budget</h3>

<div id="A2.SS10.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A2.SS10.p1.1" class="ltx_p">This subsection reports the <em id="A2.SS10.p1.1.1" class="ltx_emph ltx_font_italic">best EM per domain</em> as <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> varies at the headline budget <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="B{=}20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">B{=}20</annotation></semantics></math>, holding the total generation count fixed. For each <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m3" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> value, we take the maximum EM across all <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m4" class="ltx_Math" alttext="(s,m)" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>m</mi><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">(s,m)</annotation></semantics></math> combinations satisfying <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m5" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}+s(m{-}1)=20" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mrow><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo stretchy="false">(</mo><mrow><mi>m</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><mo stretchy="false">)</mo></mrow></mrow></mrow><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}+s(m{-}1)=20</annotation></semantics></math> in the per-domain sweep. The range across <math id="A2.SS10.p1.m6" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><msub><mi>k</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}</annotation></semantics></math> measures how sensitive each domain is to the choice of root width.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A2.T15" class="ltx_table">
<table id="A2.T15.3" class="ltx_tabular ltx_centering ltx_guessed_headers ltx_align_middle">
<thead class="ltx_thead">
<tr id="A2.T15.3.1" class="ltx_tr">
<th id="A2.T15.3.1.1" class="ltx_td ltx_align_left ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_th_row ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><span id="A2.T15.3.1.1.1" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Domain</span></th>
<th id="A2.T15.3.1.2" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><math id="A2.T15.m1" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}{=}2" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}{=}2</annotation></semantics></math></th>
<th id="A2.T15.3.1.3" class="ltx_td ltx_align_right ltx_th ltx_th_column ltx_border_tt" style="padding-left:4.0pt;padding-right:4.0pt;"><math id="A2.T15.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="k_{1}{=}4" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi mathsize="0.900em">k</mi><mn mathsize="0.900em">1</mn></msub><mo mathsize="0.900em">=</mo><mn mathsize="0.900em">4</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">k_{1}{=}4</annotation></semantics></math></th>
